    "body": "Consider the following C program:\n\n#include<stdio.h>\n\nint main()\n\nint i, j, k = 0;\nj=2 * 3 / 4 + 2.0 / 5 + 8 / 5;\nk-=--j;\nfor (i=0; i<5; i++)\n\nswitch(i+k)\n\ncase 1:\ncase 2: printf(\"\\n%d\", i+k);\ncase 3: printf(\"\\n%d\", i+k);\ndefault: printf(\"\\n%d\", i+k);\n\nreturn 0;\n\nThe number of times printf statement executed is ___.\n\nProgramming and Data Structures Iterative Statements",
