    "body": "The output of executing the following C program is___________.\n\n#include <studio.h>\n\nint total (int v){\n\nstatic int count = 0;\n\nwhile (v){\n\ncount += v&1;\n\nv >>= 1;\n\nreturn count;\n\nvoid main()\n\nstatic int x=0;\n\nint i=5;\n\nfor( ; i>0; i- -){\n\nx = x+ total (i);\n\nprintf (''%d\\n'', x);",
