    "body": "Consider the following C function.\n\nint fun (int n){\n\nint x=1, k ;\n\nif (n==1) return x ;\n\nfor (k=1 ; k<n ;++k)\n\nx=x+ fun (k) * fun (n-k) ;\n\nreturn x ;\n\nThe return value of fun (5) is",
