    "exam": "GATE-2021: 2M",
    "body": "Consider the following ANSI C function:\n\nint SimpleFunction (int Y[ ], int n, int x)\n\nint total =Y[0], loopIndex;\n\nfor ( loopIndex =1 ; loopIndex <=n-l; loopIndex ++)\n\ntotal = x * total +Y[ loopIndex ] ;\n\nreturn total;\n\nLet Z be an array of 10 elements with Z[i]=1, for all i such that 0 ≤ i ≤ 9.\n\nThe value returned by SimpleFunction (Z, 10,2) is____",
