    "num": 8,
    "type": "NAT",
    "exam": "GATE-2019 : 2M",
    "body": "Consider the following C program:\n\n#include<stdio.h>\n\nint main( )\n\nint a[ ] = {2, 4, 6, 8, 10};\n\nint i, sum = 0, *b = a + 4;\n\nfor (i = 0; i < 5; i++)\n\nsum = sum + (*b - i) -*(b - i);\n\nprintf(\"%d\\n\", sum);\n\nreturn 0;\n\nThe output of the above C program is____________.",
