    "type": "NAT",
    "exam": "GATE-2017 : 2M",
    "body": "Consider the following snippet of a C program. Assume that swap (&x, &y) exchanges the content of x and y.\n\nint main ( ) {\n\nint array [ ] = {3 , 5 , 1 , 4 , 6 , 2};\n\nint done = 0;\n\nint i;\n\nwhile ( done ==0){\n\ndone =1\n\nfor (i=0 ; i<=4 ; i++){\n\nif (array [i] < array [i+1]){\n\nswap(&array[i], &array[ i + 1]);\n\ndone =0;\n\nfor (i=5 ; i>=1 ; i- -)\n\nif (array [i] > array [i-1])\n\nswap (&array[i], &array[i-1]);\n\ndone =0;\n\nprintf (\"%d\", array [3]);\n\nThe output of the program is_________",
