    "num": 27,
    "type": "MCQ",
    "exam": "GATE-2018 : 2M",
    "body": "Consider the following C program:\n\n#include<stdio.h>\n\nvoid fun1 (char* s1 , char* s2) {\n\nchar* temp;\n\ntemp = s1;\n\ns1 = s2;\n\ns2 = temp;\n\nvoid fun2 (char** s1 , char** s2) {\n\nchar* temp;\n\ntemp = *s1;\n\n*s1 = *s2\n\n*s2 = temp ;\n\nint main( ){\n\nchar *str1 = \"Hi\", *str2= \"Bye\";\n\nfun1(str1, str2);\n\nprintf(\"%s %s\", str1, str2);\n\nfun2(&str1, &str2);\n\nprintf(\"%s, %s\", str1 , str2);\n\nreturn 0;\n\nThe output of the program above is\n\n(a) Hi Bye Bye Hi\n\n(b) Hi Bye Hi Bye\n\n(c) Bye Hi Hi Bye\n\n(d) Bye Hi Bye Hi\n\nPointers and Strings",
