    "body": "What is the worst case time complexity of inserting n elements into an empty linked list, if the linked list needs to be maintained in sorted order?\n\n(a) Θ(n)\n(b) Θ(n log n)\n\n(c) Θ(n2)\n(d) Θ(1)",
