    "body": "Consider a double hashing scheme in which the primary hash function is ℎ1 (𝑘) = 𝑘 𝑚𝑜𝑑 23 and the secondary hash function is ℎ2 (𝑘) = 1 + (𝑘 𝑚𝑜𝑑 19). Assume that the table size is 23. Then the address returned by probe 1 in the probe sequence (assume that the probe sequence begins at probe 0) for key value 𝑘 = 90 is _______",
