    "body": "The attributes of three arithmetic operators in some programming language are given below. Operator Precedence Associativity Arity\n+\nHigh Left Binary\n-\nMedium Right Binary * Low Left Binary\n\nThe value of the expression 2 - 5 + 1 - 7 * 3 in this language is ________.",
