    "type": "NAT",
    "exam": "GATE-2014: 2M",
    "body": "A machine has a 32-bit architecture, with 1-word long instructions. It has 64 registers, each of which is 32 bits long. It needs to support 45 instructions,\n\nComputer Organization and Architecture which have an immediate operand in addition to two register operands. Assuming that the immediate operand is an unsigned integer, the maximum value of the immediate operand is ________.",
