    "body": "Relation R has eight attributes ABCDEFGH.\n\nFields of R contain only atomic values.\n\nF = {CH → G, A → BC, B → CFH, E → A, F → EG}\nis a set of functional\n\ndependencies (FDs) so that F+ is exactly the set of FDs that hold for R.\n\nHow many candidate keys does the relation R have?\n\n(a) 3\n\n(b) 4\n\n(c) 5\n\n(d) 6\n\nMembership Set and Equality between FD Sets",
