    "body": "Consider the following transaction involving two bank accounts x and y\n\n[read (x) ; x: = x-50 ; write(x) ; read(y) ; y: = y + 50;\nwrite(y);]\n\nTransaction and Concurrency Control\n\nThe constraint that the sum of the accounts x and y should remain constant is that of\n\n(a) Atomicity\n(b) Consistency\n\n(c) Isolation\n(d) Durability\n\nSerializable Schedule(Conflict and View)",
