    "body": "Consider the following schedule S of transactions T1,\nT2, T3 and T4;\nT1 T2 T3 T4\n\nReads(X)\n\nWrites (X) Commit\n\nWrites (x) Commit\n\nWrites(Y);\nReads (Z);\nCommit\n\nReads (X);\nReads (Y);\nCommit\n\nWhich one of the following statements is CORRECT?\n\n(a) S is conflict-serializable but not recoverable\n\n(b) S is not conflict-serializable but is recoverable\n\n(c) S is both conflict-serializable and recoverable\n\n(d) S is neither conflict-serializable nor is it\nrecoverable",
