    "exam": "GATE-2015 : 2M",
    "body": "With reference to the B+ tree index of order 1 shown below, the minimum number of nodes (including the Root node) that must be fetched in order to satisfy the following query: \"Get all records with a search key greater than or equal to 7 and less than 15'' is?",
    "subject": "DBMS",
