    "body": "The forwarding table of a router is shown below. Subnet Number Subnet Mask Interface ID 200.150.0.0 255.255.0.0 1 200.150.64.0 255.255.224.0 2 200.150.68.0 255.255.255.0 3 200.150.68.64 255.255.255. 224 4 default\n\n0\n\nA packet addressed to a destination address 200.150.68.118 arrives at the router. It will be forwarded to the interface with ID_____ .",
