    "exam": "GATE-2019 : 2M",
    "body": "Consider three machines M, N and P with IP addresses 100.10.5.2, 100.10.5.5, and 100.10.5.6 respectively. The subnet mask is set to 255.255.255.252 for all the three machines. Which one of the following is true?\n\n(a) M, N, and P all belong to the same subnet\n\n(b) Only M and N belong to the same subnet\n\n(c) Only N and P belong to the same subnet\n\n(d) Only N and P belong to the same subnet",
