    "exam": "GATE-2008: 2M",
    "body": "If a class B network on the Internet has a subnet mask of 255.255.248.0, what is the maximum number of hosts per subnet?\n\n(a) 1022\n(b) 1023\n\n(c) 2046\n(d) 2047\nClassless Addressing",
