    "solution": "Given,\n\nSubnet Mask: 255.255.248.0\n\nSM : 11111111.11111111.11111000.00000000 HID = 11 bit\n\nMaximum number of Hosts/Subnet = 211 - 2\n\n= 2048 - 2\n\n= 2046\n\nSo, option C is the correct answer.",
