    "type": "NAT",
    "exam": "GATE-2014 : 2M",
    "body": "An IP router implementing Classless Inter-domain Routing (CIDR) receives a packet with address 131.23.151.76. The router's routing table has the following entries: Prefix Output Interface Identifier 131.16.0.0/12 3 131.28.0.0/14 5 131.19.0.0/16 2 131.22.0.0/15 1\n\nThe identifier of the output interface on which this packet will be forwarded is _____",
