    "body": "How many bytes of data can be sent in 15 seconds over a serial link with baud rate of 9600 in asynchronous mode with odd parity and two stop bits in the frame?\n\n(a) 10,000 bytes\n(b) 12,000 bytes\n\n(c) 15,000 bytes\n(d) 27,000 bytes\nFraming",
